      <p class="hint-text">${i("Ch\u1ECDn t\xE0i s\u1EA3n \u1EDF khung b\xEAn tr\xE1i \u0111\u1EC3 xem tr\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0 t\xF9y ch\u1EC9nh th\xF4ng s\u1ED1 \u1EDF c\u1ED9t Inspector b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i; nh\u1EA5p \u0111\xFAp v\xE0o th\u1EBB Nh\xE2n v\u1EADt 3D \u0111\u1EC3 m\u1EDF h\u1ED9p tho\u1EA1i Chi ti\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp.","Select any asset on the left to preview and configure in the right Inspector; double-click a 3D Character card to open its standalone Inspector dialog.")}</p>
